# The 4 files below are the only ones Tauri's Windows NSIS/MSI bundling
# actually reads (referenced by src-tauri/tauri.conf.json's `bundle.icon`
# list). Every other file `npx tauri icon` produces is a free byproduct for
# macOS / iOS / Android / Windows Appx packaging that this Windows-only
# project never bundles. Whitelist the 4 + .gitignore and ignore everything
# else so a future regen does not bloat the working tree.

# Ignore every non-dot-prefixed file in this directory by default.
*
# Re-include the 4 icons tauri.conf.json names verbatim.
!32x32.png
!128x128.png
!128x128@2x.png
!icon.ico
# Defensive re-include: the leading `*` would otherwise match .gitignore's
# basename since `.` is a non-`/` character. (.gitignore files are special-
# cased by git and tracked regardless, but this line keeps the basename
# re-inclusion explicit so the contract reads top-to-bottom.)
!.gitignore
